<section class="apdp-dialfit-story alta-pdp-flow-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full apdp-dialfit-story__layout">{% if section.settings.story_image != blank %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-story__media apdp-tail-media">{{ section.settings.story_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '480, 720, 960, 1200, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 46vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.story_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-story__copy">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '1', title: 'Your Feet Carry You All Day. Give Them <strong>15 Minutes Back.</strong>' %}<p>Long shifts. Hours of standing. Walking. Workouts. Travel.</p><p>By the end of the day, your feet can feel tight, puffy, sore and heavy — especially around the ankle where ordinary foot massagers often don’t reach.</p><p>AirRelief wraps around both the foot and ankle to deliver a relaxing combination of rhythmic compression, warming heat and vibration exactly where tired feet need it most.</p><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Strap it on. Sit back. Let your feet finally switch off.</p></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section apdp-dialfit-mechanism"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full"><div class="apdp-dialfit-mechanism__layout"><div class="apdp-dialfit-mechanism__copy">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '2', title: 'Three Therapies. One Deeper Reset.' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-support-states"><div><strong>Air Compression</strong><span>Rhythmic squeeze-and-release pressure surrounds the foot and ankle to help relieve puffiness, heaviness and built-up tension.</span></div>
<div><strong>Warming Heat</strong><span>Soothing warmth helps stiff, overworked areas loosen and relax. 4 adjustable heat levels.</span></div>
<div><strong>High-Frequency Vibration</strong><span>Targeted vibration helps release tightness after standing, walking or training. 4 vibration levels.</span></div></div><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Compression moves. Heat loosens. Vibration relaxes.</p>
<p class="apdp-dialfit-mechanism__secondary">Together, they deliver a more complete reset than heat or massage alone.</p></div>{% if section.settings.mechanism_image != blank %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-mechanism__visual"><div class="apdp-dialfit-mechanism__media apdp-tail-media">{{ section.settings.mechanism_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '480, 720, 960, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 48vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.mechanism_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div></div>{% endif %}</div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '3', title: 'The Relief Your Feet Have Been Asking For' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-benefits"><article><h3>Feel Lighter After Long Days</h3><p>Rhythmic compression helps relieve the puffy, heavy feeling that can build up after hours on your feet.</p></article>
<article><h3>Loosen Tight, Stiff Ankles</h3><p>Heat and vibration work together to help overworked areas feel warmer, softer and easier to relax.</p></article>
<article><h3>Soothe End-of-Day Aches</h3><p>Give tired feet a calming reset after work, walking, workouts or travel.</p></article>
<article><h3>Choose the Pressure You Want</h3><p>With 5 intensity levels, start gentle and increase the compression when you want a deeper squeeze.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full apdp-dialfit-uses__panel">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '4', title: 'From Morning Walks to 12-Hour Shifts' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p class="airrelief-copy">Built for the moments when your feet have simply done enough.</p></div><div class="apdp-dialfit-use-cases"><article class="apdp-dialfit-use-card"><span class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__icon">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shift' %}</span><div class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__copy"><h3>Long Hours Standing</h3><p>Ideal after retail shifts, nursing, teaching, hospitality, warehouse work, cooking, delivery work or any day spent mostly on your feet.</p></div></article>
<article class="apdp-dialfit-use-card"><span class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__icon">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'suitcase' %}</span><div class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__copy"><h3>Walking &amp; Travel</h3><p>Give heavy feet a break after sightseeing, commuting, airport days or long walks.</p></div></article>
<article class="apdp-dialfit-use-card"><span class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__icon">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'run' %}</span><div class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__copy"><h3>Training &amp; Recovery</h3><p>Use after running, gym sessions or active days when your feet and ankles feel worked.</p></div></article>
<article class="apdp-dialfit-use-card"><span class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__icon">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'heart' %}</span><div class="apdp-dialfit-use-card__copy"><h3>Evening Wind-Down</h3><p>Slip it on while watching TV, reading or relaxing before bed.</p></div></article></div><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Work · Walk · Train · Travel · Recover</p></div></section><section class="apdp-tail alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '5', title: 'More Than Heat. More Convenient Than a Foot Spa.' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p class="airrelief-copy">AirRelief combines compression, warmth and vibration in one wearable device. Typical alternatives vary by model.</p></div><div class="apdp-massager-comparison-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Compare massage options; scroll horizontally on small screens"><div class="apdp-dialfit-compare apdp-massager-compare" role="table" aria-label="Foot comfort options"><div class="apdp-dialfit-compare__head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Feature</span><span role="columnheader">Altaeron AirRelief</span><span role="columnheader">Heating Pad</span><span role="columnheader">Compression Socks</span><span role="columnheader">Foot Spa</span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Air compression</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">—</span><span role="cell">Passive only</span><span role="cell">—</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Warming heat</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">—</span><span role="cell">✓</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Vibration massage</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">—</span><span role="cell">—</span><span role="cell">Varies by model</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Foot + ankle coverage</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">Partial</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">Mostly foot</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Adjustable intensity</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">Limited</span><span role="cell">—</span><span role="cell">Limited</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Cordless</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">Sometimes</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">—</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Easy while relaxing</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">✓</span><span role="cell">Requires setup</span></div><div class="apdp-dialfit-compare__media-row" role="row">{% for index in (1..2) %}{% assign image_key = 'comparison_image_' | append: index %}{% assign comparison_image = section.settings[image_key] %}{% if comparison_image != blank %}<figure class="apdp-dialfit-compare__media" role="cell">{{ comparison_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '320, 480, 720, 960, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 50vw', alt: comparison_image.alt | default: product.title }}</figure>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div></div><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Why settle for one type of relief when your feet can have all three?</p></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '6', title: 'Your Massage. Your Intensity.' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p class="airrelief-copy">Not every tired foot needs the same treatment. Personalize each session with adjustable compression, heat and vibration.</p></div><div class="apdp-dialfit-benefits"><article><h3>3 Air Compression Cycles</h3><p>Switch between different compression rhythms.</p></article>
<article><h3>5 Compression Intensity Levels</h3><p>Go from a gentle squeeze to deeper pressure.</p></article>
<article><h3>4 Heat Levels</h3><p>Choose the soothing warmth that feels right.</p></article>
<article><h3>4 Vibration Levels</h3><p>Adjust from lighter relaxation to a stronger massage sensation.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '7', title: 'Relief in 3 Simple Steps' %}<ol class="apdp-dialfit-steps apdp-massager-steps-three" data-apdp-step-timeline><li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">A</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>1 · Wrap</h3><p>Place AirRelief around your foot and ankle, then secure the adjustable hook-and-loop strap.</p></div></li>
<li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">B</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>2 · Choose</h3><p>Select your preferred compression cycle and intensity, then adjust heat and vibration to your comfort.</p></div></li>
<li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>3 · Relax</h3><p>Sit back for around 15 minutes and let AirRelief do the work.</p></div></li></ol><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">No soaking. No rolling. No massage gun to hold. Just put it on and relax.</p></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '8', title: 'What 15 Minutes Can Feel Like' %}<ol class="apdp-dialfit-steps apdp-massager-steps-three" data-apdp-step-timeline><li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">A</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>First Few Minutes</h3><p>Warmth builds as compression begins its steady squeeze-and-release rhythm.</p></div></li>
<li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">B</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>By the End of the Session</h3><p>Tight, overworked areas can feel warmer, looser and less heavy.</p></div></li>
<li class="apdp-dialfit-step" data-apdp-step><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__number" aria-hidden="true">C</span><span class="apdp-dialfit-step__connector" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="apdp-dialfit-step__copy"><h3>After Long Days</h3><p>That “I need to get off my feet” feeling can turn into a more comfortable evening.</p></div></li></ol><div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p class="airrelief-copy">No appointment. No soaking. No complicated recovery routine.</p></div><div class="apdp-dialfit-proof">{% if section.settings.proof_video != blank or section.settings.proof_image_1 != blank %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-proof__grid">{% if section.settings.proof_video != blank %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-proof__video">{{ section.settings.proof_video | video_tag: autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, controls: true, playsinline: true, preload: 'metadata', image_size: '1200x' }}</div>{% endif %}{% for index in (1..4) %}{% assign image_key = 'proof_image_' | append: index %}{% assign proof_image = section.settings[image_key] %}{% if proof_image != blank %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-proof__image">{{ proof_image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: proof_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}</div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '9', title: 'Your Foot Massage Doesn’t Need a Power Outlet.' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>A built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery keeps your relaxation from being tied to one chair or room. Use it on the sofa, at your desk, in bed, while traveling or after training.</p><p>A full charge provides approximately 1–2 hours of total use, depending on the settings selected. At around 15 minutes per session, one charge can cover several sessions.</p><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Recharge. Strap on. Relax anywhere.</p></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '10', title: 'Adjustable Comfort for Different Feet' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>The flexible wrap adapts to different foot and ankle shapes. A secure hook-and-loop closure lets you adjust the fit until it feels comfortably snug without constantly slipping or needing to be held in place.</p><p class="apdp-dialfit-highlight">Secure. Adjustable. Easy to wear.</p></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '11', title: 'Made for Feet That Work Hard' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p>For feet that feel heavy after standing, puffy by evening, stiff after sitting or travel, sore after walking, tight after exercise, cold or overworked after long shifts.</p><p>If your favorite moment of the day is finally taking your shoes off, AirRelief was made for that moment.</p></div></div></section><section id="AltaeronMedicalReview-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-expert alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section" tabindex="-1"><div class="apdp-shell">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '12', title: 'Medical Review' %}<div class="apdp-expert__panel"><div class="apdp-expert__portrait apdp-massager-neutral-portrait">{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_portrait != blank %}{{ section.settings.reviewer_portrait | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '360, 720, 1200', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw', alt: section.settings.reviewer_portrait.alt | default: product.title }} {% else %}{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}{% endif %}</div><div class="apdp-expert__profile"><small>{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_name != blank %}Reviewed by{% else %}Massage methods &amp; everyday comfort{% endif %}</small>{% if section.settings.reviewer_verified and section.settings.reviewer_name != blank %}<h2>{{ section.settings.reviewer_name | escape }}</h2><p>{{ section.settings.reviewer_credentials | escape }}</p>{% else %}<h2>Compression · Warmth · Vibration</h2><p>Independent medical review pending. General product information; no clinician endorsement is claimed.</p>{% endif %}</div><blockquote><span aria-hidden="true">“</span><p>{{ section.settings.medical_body | escape }}<b aria-hidden="true">”</b></p></blockquote><div class="apdp-expert__criteria"><p>AirRelief brings these three massage methods into one wearable device, making it easy to add a short relaxation session to an everyday routine without a bulky foot spa or handheld massage tool.</p><p>Designed for relaxation and post-activity comfort. It is not intended to diagnose, treat or cure a medical condition.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="apdp-education alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section "><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '13', title: 'Product Specifications' %}<div class="apdp-dialfit-compare apdp-massager-specs" role="table" aria-label="AirRelief specifications"><div role="row"><span role="rowheader">System</span><span role="cell">Air compression + warming heat + high-frequency vibration</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Compression</span><span role="cell">3 programmable cycles · 5 intensity levels</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Heat</span><span role="cell">4 heat levels</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Vibration</span><span role="cell">4 vibration levels</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Session</span><span role="cell">Approximately 15 minutes</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Battery</span><span role="cell">1200mAh rechargeable lithium battery</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Rated voltage / power</span><span role="cell">DC 3.7V / 5W</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Charging / runtime</span><span role="cell">Approximately 3 hours / 1–2 hours depending on settings</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Dimensions</span><span role="cell">Approximately 20 × 17 × 4 cm</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Material</span><span role="cell">Soft technical / OK cloth + ABS control housing</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Color</span><span role="cell">Black</span></div>
<div role="row"><span role="rowheader">Fit</span><span role="cell">Adjustable hook-and-loop wrap</span></div></div><div class="apdp-dialfit-copy"><p class="airrelief-copy"><strong>In the box:</strong> 1 × Altaeron AirRelief massager unit with controls, charging cable, instruction manual and packaging box.</p></div></div></section><section class="apdp-tail apdp-tail-faq apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-section-heading', number: '14', title: 'Frequently Asked Questions' %}<div class="apdp-tail-accordion"><details><summary>How long should I use AirRelief?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>A typical session is around 15 minutes, making it easy to use after work, walking, exercise or anytime your feet feel tired and overworked.</p></details><details><summary>Does AirRelief massage both the foot and ankle?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief wraps around the foot and ankle, allowing compression, warmth and vibration to work around both areas.</p></details><details><summary>How strong is the compression?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>You can choose from 5 intensity levels, so you can start with a gentler squeeze and increase the pressure to your comfort.</p></details><details><summary>How many compression modes are there?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief offers 3 programmable air-compression cycles so you can change the rhythm of the massage.</p></details><details><summary>How many heat levels does it have?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief provides 4 adjustable heat levels so you can choose the amount of warmth that feels best.</p></details><details><summary>How many vibration levels does it have?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief provides 4 vibration levels, letting you adjust the massage sensation from lighter relaxation to a stronger feel.</p></details><details><summary>Can compression, heat and vibration be used together?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief combines air compression, warming heat and vibration to create a more complete foot-and-ankle massage experience.</p></details><details><summary>Can I walk while wearing AirRelief?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>AirRelief is best used while sitting, reclining or resting so the wrap stays comfortably positioned and you can fully relax during the session.</p></details><details><summary>Is AirRelief cordless?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Yes. AirRelief uses a built-in 1200mAh rechargeable battery, so you can use it without staying connected to a power outlet.</p></details><details><summary>How long does the battery last?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>A full charge provides approximately 1–2 hours of total use, depending on the settings selected.</p></details><details><summary>Will it fit my foot?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>The adjustable hook-and-loop design accommodates a range of foot and ankle shapes and lets you adjust how snug the wrap feels.</p></details><details><summary>When is the best time to use it?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>Use AirRelief after long work shifts, walking, travel, workouts or during your evening wind-down whenever your feet feel heavy, tight or tired.</p></details><details><summary>What if it isn't right for me?{% render 'icon-accordion-chevron', class: 'apdp-tail-accordion__chevron' %}</summary><p>You're covered by Altaeron's 30-Day Comfort Guarantee. Try AirRelief during your normal routine and contact us within the guarantee period if it isn't right for you.</p></details></div></section><section class="apdp-dialfit-guarantee-section apdp-tail alta-pdp-flow-section apdp-dialfit-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-dialfit-full"><div class="apdp-dialfit-guarantee">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}<div><h2>Try AirRelief at Home for 30 Days</h2><p>Your feet should feel better after using your massager — not make you wonder whether you wasted your money.</p><p>Try Altaeron AirRelief at home after work, walking, workouts or during your evening routine. If it isn’t the relaxing foot-and-ankle reset you expected, you’re covered by our 30-Day Comfort Guarantee.</p></div><a class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" href="#AirReliefFinal-{{ section.id }}">TRY AIRRELIEF AT HOME →</a></div><p class="apdp-dialfit-gifting">Secure Checkout · Free &amp; Tracked Shipping · 30-Day Comfort Guarantee</p></div></section><section id="AltaeronVerified-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-shell apdp-review-summary"{% if review_count == 0 %} hidden{% endif %}><h2>AirRelief Customer Reviews</h2><div id="judgeme_product_reviews" class="jdgm-widget jdgm-review-widget" data-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-id="{{ product.id }}" data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" data-widget="review" data-auto-install="false" data-entry-point="review_widget.js" data-entry-key="review-widget/main.js"></div>{% if product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data %}<script>window.jdgm=window.jdgm||{};window.jdgm.data=window.jdgm.data||{};window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget=window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget||{};window.jdgm.data.reviewWidget[{{ product.id | json }}]={{ product.metafields.judgeme.review_widget_data }};</script>{% endif %}</section><section id="AirReliefFinal-{{ section.id }}" class="apdp-final-cta alta-pdp-flow-section"><div class="apdp-shell apdp-final-cta__inner">{% if section.settings.final_cta_image != blank %}<div class="apdp-final-cta__product apdp-tail-media">{{ section.settings.final_cta_image | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '320, 500, 700', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 330px, 70vw', alt: section.settings.final_cta_image.alt | default: product.title }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="apdp-final-cta__content"><h2>Your Feet Have Done Enough for Today.</h2><p>Your feet carried you through the day. Now give them 15 minutes back.</p><div class="apdp-final-benefits"><span>{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'sliders' %}<b>Compression.</b></span><span>{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'spark' %}<b>Heat.</b></span><span>{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'heart' %}<b>Vibration.</b></span></div><p>No appointment. No soaking. No massage gun to hold.</p><p>{{ product.title | escape }}</p>      <div class="apdp-final-payments">
        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'altaeron_pdp_dialfit.accessibility.payment_methods' | t }}</span>
        {%- liquid
          assign final_payment_prefix = 'apdp-massager-final-' | append: section.id | append: '-'
          assign final_payment_id = ' id="' | append: final_payment_prefix
          assign final_payment_labelledby = 'aria-labelledby="' | append: final_payment_prefix
          assign final_payment_url = 'url(#' | append: final_payment_prefix
          assign final_payment_href = 'href="#' | append: final_payment_prefix
        -%}
        <ul class="list list-payment" role="list">
          {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
            {%- capture payment_svg -%}{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'icon icon--full-color' }}{%- endcapture -%}
            <li class="list-payment__item">{{ payment_svg | replace: ' id="', final_payment_id | replace: 'aria-labelledby="', final_payment_labelledby | replace: 'url(#', final_payment_url | replace: 'href="#', final_payment_href }}</li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
</div><div class="apdp-final-cta__buy"><p><strong data-apdp-final-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</strong><s data-apdp-final-compare{% if current_compare <= current_variant.price %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ current_compare | money }}</s></p><button type="button" class="apdp-final-button" data-apdp-final-submit{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>GIVE MY FEET 15 MINUTES<span data-apdp-final-button-price> — {{ current_variant.price | money }}</span></button><p class="apdp-final-fine">Free &amp; Tracked Shipping · 30-Day Comfort Guarantee</p></div><div class="apdp-final-badge" aria-hidden="true"><div class="apdp-dialfit-seal">{% render 'altaeron-pdp-icon', icon: 'shield' %}</div></div></div></section>
<div class="apdp-sticky" data-apdp-sticky hidden><div class="apdp-sticky__product"><span>Altaeron™ AirRelief <b data-apdp-sticky-price>{{ current_variant.price | money }}</b></span></div><button class="apdp-button apdp-button--primary" type="button" data-apdp-sticky-submit{% unless current_variant.available %} disabled{% endunless %}><span data-apdp-sticky-text>{{ cta_label | escape }}</span></button></div><script type="application/json" data-apdp-product-json>{{ product.variants | json }}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{{ product | structured_data }}</script></div>
